    <string id="TeethPrompt">Comma-separated, one value per gear. When a preset is selected it shows the preset's values; choose Custom to edit them.</string>
    <string id="PresetPrompt">Pick a common Shimano setup. It stays active and mirrors its chainring count and teeth into the fields above for reference. Choose Custom to edit them manually.</string>
