    <string id="OptDisplayBoth">Both</string>
    <string id="ForgetPrompt">Turn on and save to release the current Di2 and connect to the nearest one on the next scan. The switch turns itself back off.</string>
    <string id="AboutText">Di2 Field by Sergey Lapshin. Shows your Shimano Di2 gear, gear ratio and D-Fly battery over Bluetooth, and records a full ride summary (ratios, shifts, gear combos) to the activity. Setup: pick a Front/Cassette preset to set your gearing in one tap (it mirrors the chainrings, cassette and teeth into the fields for reference), or choose Custom to enter every value by hand. Tested with Shimano XT Di2 RD-M8250-SGS (12-speed) on Garmin Edge Explore 2. Unofficial app, not affiliated with Shimano.</string>

